            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nIn this text, we will explore another number system that was used in Europe for several centuries. For a better understanding, we suggest studying the texts in which we explain how we created our numbers before proceeding (<htcite0>; <htcite1>).",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "9618a83e-f232-49db-84f6-fc3455a3f1d1",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Drawing to count",
                     "date_time": {
